[34m##[0m[37m [0m[34mHow the polyglot works[0m

[37m-[0m[37m **Python** sees[0m[37m [0m[32m`[0m[32m#if 0[0m[32m`[0m[37m, [0m[32m`[0m[32m#endif[0m[32m`[0m[37m as comments[0m[37m.[0m[37m The C[0m[37m code sits inside[0m[37m a triple-quoted string[0m[37m ([0m[32m`[0m[32m""" ... """[0m[32m`[0m[37m), so Python ignores[0m[37m it and[0m[37m runs[0m[37m the [0m[32m`[0m[32mfib[0m[32m`[0m[37m code[0m[37m at the top.[0m
[37m-[0m[37m [0m[1;33m**[0m[1;33mC[0m[1;33m**[0m[37m sees [0m[32m`[0m[32m#if 0 ... #endif[0m[32m`[0m[37m and[0m[37m skips the Python code.[0m[37m The [0m[32m`[0m[32m"""[0m[32m`[0m[37m delimiter lines are hidden[0m[37m inside[0m[37m [0m[32m`[0m[32m#if 0[0m[32m`[0m[37m blocks, so the[0m[37m C[0m[37m code[0m[37m compiles normally[0m[37m.[0m

[37mThe[0m[37m delimiter lines are[0m[37m written as [0m[32m`[0m[32m""" "[0m[32m`[0m[37m and [0m[32m`[0m[32m""" #"[0m[32m`[0m[37m — balanced[0m[37m quotes[0m[37m for C (no warnings[0m[37m) while still being[0m[37m a valid string[0m[37m open/close for[0m[37m Python.[0m

[34m##[0m[37m [0m[34mImplementation notes[0m

[37m-[0m[37m [0m[1;33m**[0m[1;33mPython[0m[1;33m**[0m[37m: fast-d[0m[37moubling Fibonacci[0m[37m, so it[0m[37m's[0m[37m fast even for large [0m[32m`[0m[32mN[0m[32m`[0m[37m and uses arbitrary-precision ints.[0m
[37m-[0m[37m [0m[1;33m**[0m[1;33mC[0m[1;33m**[0m[37m: a small base-10[0m[37m⁹ b[0m[37mignum implementation with iterative[0m[37m addition, so it correctly[0m[37m handles[0m[37m [0m[32m`[0m[32mN ≥ 93[0m[32m`[0m[37m (where[0m[37m [0m[32m`[0m[32munsigned long long[0m[32m`[0m[37m would[0m[37m overflow) and[0m[37m prints exact values[0m[37m.[0m

